Swap two variable without temp variable. such as a = 5, b = 3
1) 
   a= a+b;  // a=8    
   b= a-b;  // b= 8-3= 5      
   a= a-b;  // a= 8-5= 3
2) 
   b= a-b   // b= 2
   a= a-b   // a= 5-2= 3
   b= a+b   // b= 3+2= 5
   
3) using xor. (for same 0, not same 1)
   a= a^b   // 0101 ^ 0011 = 0110 (6)  
   b= a^b   // 0110 ^ 0011 = 0101 (5)
   a= a^b   // 0110 ^ 0101 = 0011 (3)
4) 
   b= a^b    
   a= a^b
   b= a^b
5) 
   a = a * b
   b = a / b
   a = a / b
6) 
   a = (a + b) - (b = a)
7) 
   a = a | b
   b = a & b
   a = a ^ b
